<title>CROATIA: Croatia June RPI slows to 0.2 pct, 3.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Croatia June RPI slows to 0.2 pct, 3.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Bureau of Statistics</p>
<p>issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA RETAIL PRICES     JUNE     MAY    JAN-JUNE   JUNE 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month (pct)	+0.2    +0.4	 --	 +0.5</p>
<p> Year-on-year		  +3.4    +3.6	+3.8	+4.1</p>
<p>-- Zagreb newsroom + 385 1 455 7075</p>
